----------------------------------------------------------------------
Dependency: RISC Zero zkVM
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Tiresias proves every answer with the RISC Zero zero-knowledge virtual machine.
Its prover binary, tiresias-prover (zkvm/), links the risc0-zkvm crates, and its
guest program is built with risc0-build in RISC Zero's guest builder image.
Proving runs in RISC Zero's r0vm, installed separately with rzup.

